{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777272449634","title":"Buku ini mengunci perspektif developer-first untuk AI integration, bukan research-first model building","desc":"Dengan mengatakan buku ini ditulis oleh developer untuk developer, penulis menetapkan scope: AI akan dijelaskan sebagai komponen software untuk sistem nyata, bukan sebagai domain riset model dari nol.","updated":1777276098027,"created":1777272449632,"tags":["zettel","ai","developer","integration","the-developers-guide-to-ai","part-i"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"83d5f93f2f3a17bb543e2703e790ce5a","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.developer","alias":"developer","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.developer"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.integration","alias":"integration","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.integration"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.part-i","alias":"part-i","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.part-i"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1304},"end":{"line":24,"column":51,"offset":1352},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449634","id":"zettel.1777272449634","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":3,"offset":1355},"end":{"line":25,"column":48,"offset":1400},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":3,"offset":295},"end":{"line":7,"column":27,"offset":319},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449634"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"supporting-quote":{"type":"header","text":"Supporting quote","value":"supporting-quote","line":24,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-penting":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini penting","value":"kenapa-ini-penting","line":28,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":32,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":39,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"buku-ini-mengunci-perspektif-developer-first-untuk-ai-integration-bukan-research-first-model-building\">Buku ini mengunci perspektif developer-first untuk AI integration, bukan research-first model building<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#buku-ini-mengunci-perspektif-developer-first-untuk-ai-integration-bukan-research-first-model-building\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini bukan sekadar klaim marketing. Ini adalah deklarasi scope: buku ini akan mengajarkan AI dari perspektif penggunaan pretrained models dalam sistem software nyata—dengan fokus pada API, prompt, retrieval, dan agentic workflow—bukan perspektif riset model atau matematika teoritis.</p>\n<h2 id=\"supporting-quote\">Supporting quote<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#supporting-quote\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“This book is written by developers for developers.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-penting\">Kenapa ini penting<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-penting\"></a></h2>\n<p>Bagian \"for developers\" menentukan topik yang dipilih dan topik yang dikecualikan. Pilihan materi, urutan bab, dan cara menjelaskan semuanya akan berjalan lewat lensa practical engineering: panggil model, perbaiki prompt, hubungkan ke data, gunakan fine-tuning bila ada ROI, dan bangun agent serta tools.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\"For developers\" berarti problem yang dibahas adalah integrasi dan penggunaan AI di sistem, bukan pengembangan foundational model.</li>\n<li>\"By developers\" memberi sinyal bahwa pendekatannya akan pragmatis dan berbasis use case, bukan derivasi matematika.</li>\n<li>Ini juga menjadi mekanisme ekspektasi: pembaca harus mengharapkan roadmap yang masuk akal untuk developer, bukan silabus akademik ML.</li>\n<li>Jadi buku ini mendefinisikan \"developer\" sebagai system builder yang menggabungkan komponen untuk menghasilkan nilai, bukan sekadar coder atau AI researcher.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I / Preface</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">developer (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">integration (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">part-i (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBeha